      "en": "“They will be desolate in the middle of the countries that are desolate. Her cities will be among the cities that are wasted.",
      "ko": "황무한 열방 같이 그들도 황무할 것이며 사막이 된 성읍들 같이 그 성읍들도 사막이 될 것이라",
      "source_text_hash": "4160c6514572e64b79aac3ce1f5c5912e50258e6725827c1f7d21d65d82fc937",
      "translation_text_hash": "f8ee8300bb53d334d62feb15cd5cd5b9d4705333d9a9c8de21401170ee26d507",
