      ],
      "en": "“‘The Lord GOD says: “I will also make the multitude of Egypt to cease, by the hand of Nebuchadnezzar king of Babylon.",
      "ko": "나 주 여호와가 말하노라 내가 또 바벨론 왕 느부갓네살의 손으로 애굽 무리들을 끊으리니",
      "source_text_hash": "22981075e25cf0a7fabd56086301157b112ab5b61ad0b6a34ddce2aa62a00d2e",
      "translation_text_hash": "e6de15b407aae32987d10ddd0a10235b2d0462a528d1cf0bd24e8bd629a033c2",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
