      "en": "I will make Pathros desolate, and will set a fire in Zoan, and will execute judgments on No.",
      "ko": "내가 바드로스를 황무케 하며 소안에 불을 일으키며 노를 국문하며",
      "source_text_hash": "7d067f65e26fb903a89c60c8540efc8643835c30798589cf46dfa01dabe22d31",
      "translation_text_hash": "7ae1b791524038383aa0d62da148851b34df152e24f888972864482f0604146f",
